         <p class=\"faq-a\">A designer plans light, comfort, privacy and future growth. A contractor builds what is drawn, so the planning decides how good the office will be.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>An Office That Supports Your Growth</h2>\n            <p>A good office helps teams work better and clients trust you more. A thoughtful interior designer for office spaces builds that into every corner.</p><p>Opening or upgrading an office in Karnal? <a href=\"/karnal/contact\">Reach 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}